<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Lingui reports flat year net.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Lingui reports flat year net.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1996-09-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		   (in million ringgit unless stated)</p>
<p>    Group shr  (cents)	22.2    vs	  22.0</p>
<p>    Net profit		 108.1    vs	 107.3</p>
<p>    Turnover		   413.8    vs	 401.6</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit	   140.0    vs	 140.6</p>
<p>    Minorities	   less  2.8    vs  less   4.0</p>
<p>    Extraordinaries	    3.2    vs	   6.7</p>
<p>    Dividend   (cents)	 2.5    vs	   2.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Lingui Developments Bhd is involved in timber, plantations and quarrying business.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-201 4813)</p>
</text>
